  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "山西大同的悬空寺，整座寺贴在悬崖上，底下只见几根细柱子，看着一阵风都能吹下去。",
      "chars": 39,
      "speech_ms": 9280,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 9280,
      "trace_id": "0748763fa4b0436bbe51aaf4156a5dab"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "可这座寺从北魏年间开建，在崖上立了一千多年；先说清，如今看到的主体，多是明清时候重修的。",
      "chars": 44,
      "speech_ms": 10430,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 9680,
      "end_ms": 20110,
      "trace_id": "07487645c86eed9ba234e4d895b52a8b"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "它真正的秘密在崖壁里：修寺的人在岩壁上凿出洞，把结实的横梁插进去，主要的承重，就靠这些扎进山体的横梁。",
      "chars": 51,
      "speech_ms": 12890,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 20510,
      "end_ms": 33400,
      "trace_id": "0748764cc9e488fddda27eb006b3e89c"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您在下面看见的细柱子，不是判断它稳不稳的依据——真功夫，藏在看不见的山里头。",
      "chars": 38,
      "speech_ms": 7480,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 33800,
      "end_ms": 41280,
      "trace_id": "074876528025054362a8d2a0e1d6b0b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "所以看悬空寺，别光盯着那几根柱子心惊，要看古人把力气用在了哪儿：不在面上显险，在暗处求稳。",
      "chars": 45,
      "speech_ms": 11050,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 41680,
      "end_ms": 52730,
      "trace_id": "074876586c40f190c7d599ff69ca3c2e"
    }
  ]
}